# Local development needs no environment variables; it uses /api/aircraft.
# Static builds, including GitHub Pages, query adsb.lol through the free cors.dev relay.
# No environment variables, API key, signup or separate server deployment are needed.
# Optional: deploy api/aircraft.js yourself and create .env.pages.local.
# Set VITE_AIRCRAFT_API_URL only to that relay's verified HTTPS endpoint.
# Do not use a placeholder address or the GitHub Pages website URL.
# This address is public. Do not put secrets here.
# VITE_AIRCRAFT_API_URL=
